# env.required — without this the answer-engine query script cannot run.
# query_engines.py needs at least ONE answer-engine key; Perplexity is the canonical
# default + competitor-discovery path. If you standardize on a different single engine,
# set that engine's key instead (OPENAI_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY / TAVILY_API_KEY) and
# the script will run on it — but absent ALL of them it exits non-zero.
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY
